<section class="tab{{#if tab.active}} active{{/if}}" data-group="{{tab.group}}" data-tab="{{tab.id}}">
  <p class="hint">
    Ranges are measured in grid squares, converted from the item's own units using the scene's grid.
    A scene that is not 5 ft per square, or an item whose range is not in the scene's units, is
    handled here — but it is the first thing to check when a range boundary looks wrong.
  </p>

  <dl class="aat-doctor-env">
    {{#each environment}}
      <dt>{{this.label}}</dt>
      <dd>{{this.value}}</dd>
    {{/each}}
  </dl>
</section>
